TPC-DS benchmark dictionary data

This artifact contains unmodified dictionary resources from
io.trino.tpcds:tpcds:1.4 (https://github.com/trinodb/tpcds), whose published
Maven metadata declares Apache License, Version 2.0. Original paths are
io/trino/tpcds/distribution/*.dst. The resources are relocated to
org/apache/kyuubi/tpcds/gen/distribution/*.dst.

These resources contain benchmark data maintained by the Transaction
Processing Performance Council (TPC). Original legal notices, including
attribution to Gradient Systems, are retained in the resource files.

The new generator does not contain Trino generator classes or native
TPC-DS source code. The TPC-DS name identifies the benchmark data format.
